  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "A considerable amount of playback failures in VRChat is reported by players in Japan, within the week.\n\nSome claimed to resolve the problem by either disabling IPv6, or using a proxy service e.g. Cloudflare WARP.\n\nEssentially people are being banned as a bot using yt-dlp via VRChat.\n\nI wonder if VRChat can allow players to pass certain arguements to yt-dlp to\n\n- provide their cookies (--cookies)\n\n- or disable IPv6 (-4)\n\nBecause to my observation, it does not work even if you create yt-dlp.conf in %userprofile% or the same folder with the yt-dlp.exe installation under VRChat.",
